                          %mi K
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} K
                    \-homology and Fredholm operators I: Dirac operators
                %strong 134
                (2018) 101-118 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.geomphys.2018.08.008"}> doi:10.1016/j.geomphys.2018.08.008
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            A proof of the Atiyah-Singer index theorem in terms of
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-theory"} KK-theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E-theory"} E-theory
            has been given by
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nigel+Higson"} Nigel Higson
          %ul
